* ================================================================
* AD4021 - 20-bit, 1 MSPS SAR ADC front end
* 1 V DC input, 5 V reference, 1.8 V core / 1.8 V interface supply,
* CNV conversion clock and SPI (CS mode, 3-wire) read-back
* ================================================================
* Genuine Analog Devices AD4021 model (do not redefine):
.lib AD4021.lib
*.include AD4021.cir      ; use this form if the model is a .cir file

* ---------------- Analog input source -------------------------
VIN     IN      0       DC 1
* RC charge-kickback filter between driver and ADC input
RFLT    IN      INP     22
CFLT    INP     0       1.8n
* Pseudo-differential negative input referenced to GND
RINN    INN     0       0.1

* ---------------- Reference and supplies ----------------------
VREF    REF     0       DC 5
CREF    REF     0       10u
VDD     VDD     0       DC 1.8
CVDD    VDD     0       100n
VVIO    VIO     0       DC 1.8
CVIO    VIO     0       100n

* ---------------- Conversion clock (1 MSPS) -------------------
* CNV rising edge starts the conversion, 1 us period
VCNV    CNV     0       PULSE(0 1.8 100n 1n 1n 300n 1u)

* ---------------- SPI interface -------------------------------
* SDI held high -> CS mode, 3-wire, no busy indicator
VSDI    SDI     VIO     DC 0
* 40 MHz serial clock for data read-back
VSCK    SCK     0       PULSE(0 1.8 450n 1n 1n 11n 25n)

* ---------------- ADC instance --------------------------------
* Pin order: REF VDD IN+ IN- GND CNV SDI SCK SDO VIO
XU1     REF VDD INP INN 0 CNV SDI SCK OUT VIO AD4021

* Serial data output load
CLOAD   OUT     0       10p
RLOAD   OUT     0       1MEG

* ---------------- Analysis ------------------------------------
.tran 0 5u 0 1n
.options plotwinsize=0 numdgt=7

.end
